# Normalise on the way in, and check out LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows follows `core.autocrlf`, which is on by default
# there: the working tree gets CRLF and any file written back out carries it. Every
# blob in this repository is LF already, so this changes nothing in the index -- it
# stops a platform default from being the thing that decides.
* text=auto eol=lf
